# =============================================================================
# SerOps Frontend — Production defaults (L3 fix, 2026-09-08)
# =============================================================================
# Same-origin API — Caddy (docker-compose quick-start) or ingress (Helm)
# fronts both frontend and backend on the same hostname. This is what
# every stock deployment uses; ``docker compose up`` / ``helm install``
# will Just Work with this file present.
#
# Override for cross-origin topologies (API on api.example.com serving
# app.example.com):
#     docker build --build-arg VITE_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/api .
# =============================================================================

VITE_BASE_URL=/api
